Third-party data
----------------
This repository contains or derives data from the sources below. Terms were checked on
2026-10-24; details and open items are in docs/security/P1-02-licenses.md.

- IANA Language Subtag Registry (https://www.iana.org/assignments/language-subtag-registry).
  IANA and the IETF Trust dedicate their rights in the protocol registries to the public domain
  (CC0 1.0). A subset is shipped as tracer_evalschema/data/iana_subtag_registry_subset.json.
- ISO 4217 List One, maintained by SIX Group as the ISO 4217 maintenance agency
  (https://www.six-group.com). Data derived from it is shipped as
  tracer_evalschema/data/iso4217_active.json. SIX publishes the list free of charge but states
  no reuse licence we could find; this item is open on the release checklist.
- Unicode conformance files (BidiTest.txt, BidiCharacterTest.txt) are used in tests under the
  Unicode License v3 (text in packages/evalschema/tests/fixtures/unicode/UNICODE-LICENSE-V3.txt).
  Copyright Unicode, Inc.
- Test fixtures: output from the Sarvam AI speech APIs (Sarvam AI terms of service, version 2.0)
  and short quotes from the Langfuse documentation (MIT) and Pipecat documentation (BSD-2-Clause,
  copyright Daily). The Sarvam audio redistribution terms are open on the release checklist.
